WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:39.150
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.480
...crazy about you!

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:46.930
lt was the first summer vacation
in my life where l'd had a boyfriend.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:55.130
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.540
The fun time we had flew by like an arrow.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:09.040
"'A Fleeting Love Sign"'

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.010
Adachi...

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.680
Could you stop touching my head
every time we get together?

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.680
But it feels so good!

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:22.680
Oh, but I liked how it felt most
back when I first started touching it.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.050
I was so surprised

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:27.690
when you suddenly got that crew cut
before summer vacation started.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.020
I thought I would atone
for how I acted, in my own way.

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:33.060
Here we had finally expressed
our feelings for each other,

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.030
and I went and ruined everything.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:35.700
Mm-hmm.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:39.370
Say, Toji, you feel like
becoming a goblin again?

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.700
No!

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:46.710
The new school term starts today. A lot
has happened, but we're lovey-dovey.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.040
So?

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.040
How far have you gone with Toji?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.380
--Huh!? Nothing's happened!?

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:55.050
Well, since Toji had to go to the hospital,

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.050
most of his summer vacation was
spent taking supplementary classes,

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.450
so we mostly met at the library
on his way back from those,

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.990
and doing homework together,

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.330
and once in a while, going to a movie
or the game center and stuff.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.660
That's it?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.000
Oh, we did go to watch
the fireworks that one time.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.330
You didn't go on a trip
together or anything?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.600
N- no way, I couldn't do that!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.010
And yet she looks like
such a fast mover, too!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.010
Wow, there's too big a gap between
how Adachi looks and who she is!

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.010
Isn't that precious?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:27.010
Yeah, whatever.
There's really no need to rush things.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.020
For all of the time Toji and l had lost,
l want to make the most of things now.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.250
There was only one thing
l was worried about...

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.360
Oh, look at her, over there...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.850
Wow, isn't she looking insubstantial?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.660
lt looks like she doesn't have
enough energy to fight back these days.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:02.080
Is Adachi Momo in this class?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.220
"'H- hey, what did you do?, Adachi!?"'

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.720
"'They're 2nd-years!"'

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.880
"'I didn't do anything!"'

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.660
We hear you used to be on the swim team.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:17.670
You're the reason for 1st Year
3rd Class's landslide win.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.330
You won the swim meet all by yourself.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.140
You think it's okay for a pro
like you to swim in every event?

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.870
"'What do we do!?
They're trying to pick a fight!"'

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.810
"'How could they!? There wasn't anything
in the rules against it, right?"'

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.380
Please, Adachi-san, help us!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.680
The swim club?

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.190
Mm-hmm. They said that
of the seven of them,

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.350
three of the 3rd-year members left,

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:42.220
and that their continued
existence was in danger.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.690
They kept going on about it
for a whole hour.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.690
Why not? Go ahead and join them.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:49.360
But I don't want to get
any darker than I already am!

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.700
People tell me I look mean
often enough as it is!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.700
You really do like to swim, don't you?

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.370
Mm-hmm...

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:00.970
Adachi, I'm okay with you,
no matter how tan you get.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:09.180
All right, if you say so, Toji.
I'll join the swim club.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.250
Huh? What? Adachi?

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:20.330
Huh? That's strange.
Never mind, it was nothing.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.330
l thought it was Okayasu.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.330
What's happened to him?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:31.200
l thought that by today... it would be
around time... for him to try something...

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.350
No doubt about it.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.870
Okayasu is avoiding me.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.180
lt's one of Sae's victims.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.020
Hi there.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.360
So how has Kashiwagi Sae
been treating you ever since?

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:55.360
It's been fine. She's as
gentle as a rented kitten.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.030
I guess that full disclosure
tactic really worked.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:58.870
No kidding.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:03.970
Still, I'm surprised how so many of
Sae's victims just happened to be there.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:04.970
You're kidding!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:07.640
You didn't know!?

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:11.980
I don't know how he got my number,
but the night before the swim meet,

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.310
I got a call from Okayasu.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:17.650
Sumire-chan, I heard you had
a rough time of it with Sae-chan.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:20.320
Wouldn't you like to get revenge?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.990
But I was in my first year of
middle school when Sae victimized me.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.290
I wondered why he was asking me now.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:29.660
It was the first time I'd ever
talked to Okayasu-kun, too.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.670
But then, that next day, I understood.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:36.340
It was this other girl
who he was trying to help.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:41.680
Why would he go to that much trouble
to help me? Stupid, stupid Okayasu!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:45.680
At the time, Okayasu was definitely
acting differently than usual.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.740
He knew it would be his last embrace.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.820
Okayasu!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.640
Howdy!

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:11.970
What's the matter? Momo-chan,
you seem awfully serious today.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:16.930
Okayasu, I'm sorry. I was
so wrapped up in myself...

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:20.450
Sumire-chan told me what you did.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.490
The secret's out, huh? That's right!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:29.990
Actually, I was going to
have you owe me one, Momo-chan,

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.330
and then when Toji wasn't around,
take advantage of it!

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.600
--Then the jerk goes and picks
a fine time to come back.
--l finally figured it out.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.670
All his kidding around was
out of kindness, to ease my anxiety.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.840
When things were hard,
he was always there by my side.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:45.010
Always pretending it was
a coincidence. Always...

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:49.010
Still, I guess it's all right.
You seem to be getting along well enough.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.750
For as much as Toji
once hurt you, Momo-chan,

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.040
I'll bet he's going to
treat you well from now on.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.620
Thank you, Okayasu.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:06.630
If you hadn't been there, I probably
would have dropped out of school long ago.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.160
I was only able to forget about
the trouble I was going through

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.300
when we were talking to each other.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:16.670
If I... If I had met you before Toji,
Okayasu, I might have...

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.510
You flatter me, Momo-chan.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.320
I've had it!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.980
I'm taking off.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.320
O- Okayasu?

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:35.320
I might want to hug you again
if this keeps up, Momo-chan.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.660
Bye.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.660
Oh, right...

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.460
If you ever get tired of Toji,
come and find me anytime.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.130
I'll throw in a special kiss,
no extra charge.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.470
You goof!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.940
l'm sorry, Okayasu.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.610
Thanks for taking an interest in me.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.190
Why? lt's not like
we're parting ways forever,

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.920
and yet l can't hold back the tears...

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:14.290
Adachi... Adachi... Adachi!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:15.960
What's the matter? You're spacing off.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.300
Oh, it's nothing!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.970
Sorry to drag you into helping me
with officer-of-the-day duties, Toji.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:27.310
That's okay, let's just
finish this up quick and go somewhere.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.240
Nice breeze...

00:09:58.340 --> 00:09:59.770
No!

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.340
You're kidding me...

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.750
Oh, no!

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.700
That's bad news!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.030
Guys are definitely hurt by that.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.830
Not just once, but twice now.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.710
So? Why did you drive him off again?

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:36.380
Well, he just suddenly brought
his face right up in front of me!

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.710
Up to then, the whole mood had
been something totally different.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:42.380
T- there is such a thing as needing to
prepare oneself for that, isn't there?

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.320
You've been seeing each other
for two whole months now.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.390
What's the big deal now?

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.390
So, what happened afterward?

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:53.730
Um... it got really awkward, and he
didn't talk to me the whole way home.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.060
What should I do?

00:10:56.060 --> 00:11:01.000
Momo-chi, in situations like that,
you approach him!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.700
Me, approach him?

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:19.220
There's no way l can do it. l wonder
if Toji was this worked up, too.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.210
And then, my reaction...

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.690
Why did l go and push him away?

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:29.860
When in fact, l did want to kiss him...

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:37.040
l want to kiss him...

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.040
I'm done!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.370
Ah, nice.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.710
You giving it to Toji?

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.710
Mm-hmm.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.200
Now, l'll be able to kiss him...

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:51.390
Or l should say, make up with him.
Now l'll be able to make up with Toji.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.390
Geez, I don't believe it!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.390
We're supposed to turn those in!

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:59.060
Aah, there she goes again.
Today, it's with Mayu's group, huh?

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:03.390
Apparently, Kashiwagi used to
make fun of those girls a lot before.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:14.010
Hair, check! Makeup, check! Last night,
l even did a facial pack treatment.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:18.350
All righty! Everything is ready!
Bring it on, anytime!

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:22.020
I made this in cooking class.
You don't dislike sweets, right?

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.680
Uh... no. I'll eat anything.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.690
Great! Sorry about yesterday.
It happened so suddenly, it startled me.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.220
I- it's not as though
I didn't want to. Really.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:37.700
Feels right, feels right...
All right, now to move in...

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.030
Say, Toji,

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:41.370
how about we come up
with our own little sign?

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.040
Sign?

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.710
For example, what if we make an
"'L"' with our fingers that means "'love"'?

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.970
See? See? "'L"'

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:03.820
l love you, Toji! Now it's okay
for us to say so anytime!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.340
Look, look, Kashiwagi
has been left out again.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.670
Poor thing.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.730
How does she even change her clothes?

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.940
Here it comes!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.420
Sorry! Did that hit you?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.700
Adachi-san...

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.710
Do you have a partner?
Come pair up with me.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.800
The area over there is open.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.110
Sorry, Kako. Team up with Nami and them.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.230
The area over there is available.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.680
Good morning, Momo-sama!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.680
Let me carry your bag.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.020
Here, your indoor shoes.
Go ahead, go ahead.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:42.020
Let me brush your uniform.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.030
Allow me to polish your shoes.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.030
How do you like that turnaround?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.700
I'm going to puke.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.360
Sae...

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:54.030
Act more normal. It looks
like I'm your slave driver.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.730
Right, Momo-sama!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:01.310
Oh, good morning.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:05.650
Oh, Momo-sama, are you
in a tiff with Toji-sama?

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.980
Don't butt in!

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:12.320
Oh, I wouldn't dream of it!
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:16.320
I'm sorry, Adachi, but I just can't do
that sort of thing. It's too embarrassing.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:19.490
Why? The sign is just
between the two of us,

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:22.330
so nobody else will know what it means.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.330
Yeah, but...

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:27.330
Oh, I get it. Toji, you just
don't want to say you love me.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.340
How do you figure that?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:34.740
Never mind! Toji, you just don't understand
how I feel! I don't care anymore!

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.020
Tojigamori, come up to the front.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.020
Okay.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.690
l do understand, really.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.020
Toji isn't the type of guy
who finds it so easy to say he loves you.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.360
l get that, but still...

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.030
Okay, you can go sit down.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.700
Now, from the top...

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.860
What's wrong, Tojigamori?

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.420
What are you doing?

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.990
I'm sorry, Toji. Was that embarrassing?

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:30.000
Nah, once I did it, it was
surprisingly not a big deal.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.860
It made me awfully happy. Thanks.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:44.680
Momo-sama!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:47.010
I brought your things!

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:48.680
--l- l don't believe it!
--Our next class is in the lab.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:53.020
--The mood was fantastic just now, too!
--Here you are. Let's get going.

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:55.510
l knew l shouldn't have helped her!

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.720
Adachi...

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.300
Hey!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.970
You there!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:14.310
This is who we are.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.310
Mens Monmon editorial staff?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:20.650
We're famous for having the models
Jigoro and Oji Goro. Heard of them?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.320
We've heard of them, we've heard of them!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:25.850
We're doing a special feature
on stylish high school girls

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:26.990
on street corners for our next issue,

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.560
and those loafers are great!
They really look good on you.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.330
Would you let us take your picture?

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.990
But I'm...

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.660
Oh, go ahead, go ahead!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.660
Your friend?

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:37.330
Yes!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:40.330
You don't have all
that much presence, huh?

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.000
Could you strike some
kind of interesting pose?

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.670
Muffler!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.340
Guardian spirit!

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:47.770
Pyonkichi the Frog!

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:58.910
That was quite interesting.
We'd like to shoot you here in the studio.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.960
Nice, Jigoro.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.960
You're giving off plenty
of pheromones today.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:10.950
Okay, thank you very much.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.640
There it is! The killer pheromone beam!

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.370
That's MenMon's
number one model for you.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:27.880
Oh, sorry. Are you all right?

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:33.620
Oh, thank you so much.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.660
Um... could you set me down?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:38.990
E- excuse me!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:41.330
Not at all. Thank you.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.000
What the?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.330
Look this way.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.670
Okay!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:49.030
--Why do l have to tag along for this?
--Okay, that's good.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:51.670
J- Jigoro!

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:53.340
Okay, let's take a break.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.340
Momo-sama!

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.010
Sorry, but would you mind if I headed out?

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:02.280
Huh!? But I'm so helpless on by myself!
Don't leave, Momo-sama!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.620
There's no reason for me to be here.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.620
Please, Momo-sama!
Just a little longer, okay? Okay?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.710
Just a little longer.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.630
Why are you kissing up to that girl?

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.960
You're that guy from earlier...

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:19.630
Why is she so overbearing? It's obnoxious.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.970
I- I don't like having to always
fuss over Momo-sama either,

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.540
but if I fall out of favor with Momo-sama,

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.980
I won't be able to get by
very well at school.

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:36.040
What an awful girl. I'm sure she's just
jealous because you're so cute.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:43.660
I really don't know what to say! He said
it was love at first sight when he saw me!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.660
He asked me to meet him again!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.330
You're sure this was
one of MenMon's models?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.660
And not the cameraman's
assistant or something?

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.330
I'm sure!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.700
Here, he's the one.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.670
What are you, an idiot!?

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.680
There's no way someone as famous
as Jigoro would hook up with you!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:07.680
If you're going to lie,
at least do better than that!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.680
It really is the truth!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.350
It is true that Jigoro was there yesterday,

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:18.730
but if all you ever do is lie, nobody is
ever going to listen to what you say.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.280
Got it?

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.870
What are you doing!?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.400
Huh? Isn't that Jigoro!?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.400
Why?

00:20:55.400 --> 00:21:00.330
I just couldn't forget about you.
I want you to go out with me.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:12.010
Everyone is looking at me!
They're all envious of me!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:14.350
And the one who saved me from my pinch

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:17.210
is an exceptionally handsome
and popular model!

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:20.690
l'm a heroine!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:25.150
There's no way someone as famous
as Jigoro would hook up with you!

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.360
What's the matter?

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.360
I- I don't believe it!

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:34.700
After all, we just met yesterday.
This is too good to be true.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.170
It's not true! It's not true!

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.730
You're just going to get my hopes up,
and then have a good laugh later!

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:46.710
You poor girl. What have you
been put through up to now?

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:53.710
I'm not trying to trick you. From now on,
I'll protect you. Don't cry.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:21:59.920
No way!

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:13.970
Y- you're!

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:28.080
l'm back!

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:42.740
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:52.410
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:55.410
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.410 --> 00:23:02.020
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:08.360
Where can we go

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:18.040
where we can all be

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:20.710
under the same sky?

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:29.050
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:35.720
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:42.060
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:49.400
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:58.070
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.010 --> 00:24:04.450
Wherever l go with Jigoro,
people make a fuss over us,

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:06.350
and everything is so gorgeous!

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:10.360
l don't think l could ever go back
to dating guys my age again!

00:24:10.360 --> 00:24:15.020
Next time on Peach Girl, "'Black Girl"'
